k host, not CLI-binary wall timings.\n\nValidation: 792 compiler lib tests pass, 14 ignored; workspace/all-features/all-targets Clippy with -D warnings passes; cargo fmt --all -- --check, git diff --check, and workflow YAML parsing pass. No full conformance rerun is claimed for this checkpoint. Raw local records are /tmp/rayzor-kernel-cold-start/comparison.json, comparison-summary.jsonl, mandelbrot-recheck.json, snapshot-cranelift.jsonl and snapshot-llvm.jsonl.\n\nRemaining levers: nbody optimizer time is effectively unchanged; total source startup for fasta/regexredux did not improve reliably in the no-snapshot comparison despite lower optimizer cost. Snapshot-backed startup still spends time materializing stdlib declarations and loading/binding LLVM. Keep this issue open.","files":null}]}